    "卡片消耗后无法撤销；最多尝试 3 次，间隔至少 30 秒，始终复用原请求。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Credit consumption cannot be undone; up to 3 attempts at least 30 seconds apart, always reusing the original request."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卡片消耗后无法撤销；最多尝试 3 次，间隔至少 30 秒，始终复用原请求。"
