    "每 30 秒检查。发送后以最新用量为基线，额外使用至少 1 个百分点、再恢复满额后才重新触发。关闭或重启不会清除去重记录；未知结果不补发。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checks every 30 seconds. After sending, it re-triggers only after at least 1 additional percentage point of use and a return to full quota. Closing or restarting does not clear the dedup record; unknown results are not retried."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每 30 秒检查。发送后以最新用量为基线，额外使用至少 1 个百分点、再恢复满额后才重新触发。关闭或重启不会清除去重记录；未知结果不补发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
